                <pb facs="0271" n="165" sameAs="frus:frus1891/pg165"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr. Blaine</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-21"><hi rendition="#italic">September 21,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Ex-President Balmaceda committed suicide in Argentine legation here 19th.
                    Everything tranquil.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Egan</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
